    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rug cleaning simulator is cozy, relaxing first person simulator about running small rug cleaning business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2728 MEET UNIQUE CLIENTS &amp; RUGS \u2728</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People you meet on street or in your store are procedurally generated. As a clients they will bring you completely different rugs with unique dirts to be cleaned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710530/extras/b8ec607d899c492bbdc8aa155b66ad82.poster.avif?t=1741552705\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710530/extras/b8ec607d899c492bbdc8aa155b66ad82.webm?t=1741552705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710530/extras/b8ec607d899c492bbdc8aa155b66ad82.mp4?t=1741552705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2728 CLEANING \u2728</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your dedicated tools for specified cleaning stage. Indulge in some relaxing work. More you clean, more experience you get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710530/extras/801c8a356c1429292a95f762d7a18d1a.poster.avif?t=1741552705\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710530/extras/801c8a356c1429292a95f762d7a18d1a.webm?t=1741552705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710530/extras/801c8a356c1429292a95f762d7a18d1a.mp4?t=1741552705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2728 CUSTOMISE YOUR STORE \u2728</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With money you earn and experience you get, buy new stuff &amp; customise your store to attract more clients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710530/extras/421fcac38e9cfb0243c566018328c585.poster.avif?t=1741552705\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710530/extras/421fcac38e9cfb0243c566018328c585.webm?t=1741552705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710530/extras/421fcac38e9cfb0243c566018328c585.mp4?t=1741552705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2728 UPGRADE YOUR TOOLS \u2728</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your tools to get best performance &amp; look. Gaining experience unlocks getting more performant machinery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710530/extras/ea6aa4b4ef4f055bf7fb128a59ce1414.poster.avif?t=1741552705\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710530/extras/ea6aa4b4ef4f055bf7fb128a59ce1414.webm?t=1741552705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710530/extras/ea6aa4b4ef4f055bf7fb128a59ce1414.mp4?t=1741552705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rug cleaning simulator is cozy, relaxing first person simulator about running small rug cleaning business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2728 MEET UNIQUE CLIENTS &amp; RUGS \u2728</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People you meet on street or in your store are procedurally generated. As a clients they will bring you completely different rugs with unique dirts to be cleaned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710530/extras/b8ec607d899c492bbdc8aa155b66ad82.poster.avif?t=1741552705\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710530/extras/b8ec607d899c492bbdc8aa155b66ad82.webm?t=1741552705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710530/extras/b8ec607d899c492bbdc8aa155b66ad82.mp4?t=1741552705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2728 CLEANING \u2728</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your dedicated tools for specified cleaning stage. Indulge in some relaxing work. More you clean, more experience you get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710530/extras/801c8a356c1429292a95f762d7a18d1a.poster.avif?t=1741552705\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710530/extras/801c8a356c1429292a95f762d7a18d1a.webm?t=1741552705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710530/extras/801c8a356c1429292a95f762d7a18d1a.mp4?t=1741552705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2728 CUSTOMISE YOUR STORE \u2728</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With money you earn and experience you get, buy new stuff &amp; customise your store to attract more clients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710530/extras/421fcac38e9cfb0243c566018328c585.poster.avif?t=1741552705\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710530/extras/421fcac38e9cfb0243c566018328c585.webm?t=1741552705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710530/extras/421fcac38e9cfb0243c566018328c585.mp4?t=1741552705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2728 UPGRADE YOUR TOOLS \u2728</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your tools to get best performance &amp; look. Gaining experience unlocks getting more performant machinery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710530/extras/ea6aa4b4ef4f055bf7fb128a59ce1414.poster.avif?t=1741552705\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710530/extras/ea6aa4b4ef4f055bf7fb128a59ce1414.webm?t=1741552705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710530/extras/ea6aa4b4ef4f055bf7fb128a59ce1414.mp4?t=1741552705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
